      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تعيّش</span></b>  <i>He constrained himself to obtain the
means of life:</i> (S;) or <i>he had what was barely
sufficient, of sustenance, nothing remaining over
and above it.</i> (TA.)

